#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Graph showing PINN data compared with the HDES-Qiskit "
"function.](/docs/images/tutorials/colibritd-pde/pinn-data.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Gráfico mostrando dados do PINN comparados com a função HDES-"
"Qiskit.](/docs/images/tutorials/colibritd-pde/pinn-data.avif)\n"

